      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        200
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## why\nthe halt cleared these by hand. this runs nightly and presses GitHub's «Done» for you.\n\n## what goes to Done\n- every notification you already read, whatever it is\n- an unread pr thread whose pr merged or closed\n- an unread ci-run thread whose branch has no open pr\nan unread open pr or issue stays in the inbox.\n\n## doors\n- run by hand: «Execute workflow»\n- token: 1Password `github-n8n-notifications-sweep` → credential «github notifications sweep (token)»\n- log: data table `gh_notif_swept`; a thread is sent to Done once per update (GitHub's list still returns Done threads)\n- open: one page of 100; no shared error workflow yet",
        "height": 400,
        "width": 560
      },
      "id": "9ca600be-bbf2-4391-a850-8c2f021b7c1a"
    },
